Package: mcprack-doc
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: apache2 | nginx
Suggests: mcprack
Architecture: all
Description: mcprack HTML documentation
 Sphinx-generated HTML documentation for mcprack, the MCP server catalog and
 client-configuration portal, its client tools (mcprack-client and the
 mcprack-sync-* tools), the Ansible collection and the MCP servers that ship a
 mcprack companion package.
 .
 An Apache2 configuration snippet is enabled automatically on installation.
 An Nginx configuration snippet is installed to /usr/share/doc/mcprack-doc/.
